BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bike Match Drop-Off at Sorauren Farmers' Market
DTSTART:20260713T190000Z
DTEND:20260713T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260713T083509Z
UID:e0183686-f0a7-58fe-ae89-d5d159cade70
DESCRIPTION:Cycle Toronto is collecting bike donations at the Sorauren Far
 mers' Market on Monday\, July 13 from 3:00 PM - 6:30 PM.\n\nAll donated bi
 kes go toward our Bike Match program\, which was founded by Women's Cyclin
 g Network and aims to increase access to cycling across the city while giv
 ing donated bikes a second life.\n\nCycle Toronto and our partner bike hub
 s collect donated bicycles\, repair them\, and provide them to community m
 embers in need. Interested participants can sign up through the (https://b
 ikematchwcn.com/) Bike Match website.\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/bike_ma
 tch_20260713
LOCATION:Sorauren Farmers' Market\n50 Wabash Ave\nToronto ON M6R 1N2\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/bike_match_20260713
END:VEVENT
